<title>THAILAND: Delta Electronics Q3 net rises 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Delta Electronics Q3 net rises 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 4.07	 vs	   3.61</p>
<p>    Net profit	     243.94	 vs	 206.67</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		10.64	 vs	   9.99</p>
<p>    Net profit	     638.26	 vs	 572.13</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Delta Electronics (Thailand) Plc, an electronic parts producer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
